基于 Cloud&BIM 的地铁盾构施工风险监测信息平台设计*
杨醒宇
(中铁四院集团西南勘察设计有限公司 ,云南 昆明 650206)
摘 要:传统盾构施工风险监测风险评估误差较大,为此设计了基于 Cloud&BIM 的地铁盾构施工风险监测信息平台。首先根据盾构
施工情况设计平台整体架构,优化数据采集与通信的外设条件;建立施工风险指标体系和风险评估模型,确定各种风险发生
的概率以及风险发生后所产生的损失,最后实现风险监测。通过对真实的盾构施工工程进行仿真,得到的实验结果表明,平
台得到的风险监测结果与仿真的实际施工风险出现概率相近,验证了设计的监测平台的有效性。
关键词:Cloud&BIM;地铁盾构;施工风险监测
中图分类号:TP277 文献标识码:A 文章编号:1003-7241(2022)09-0136-04
Design of Risk Monitoring Information Platform for Metro Shield Construction Based on Cloud&BIM
YANG Xing-yu
( Southwest Survey and Design Co., Ltd., of China Railway Fourth Group, Kunming 650206 China )
Abstract: The traditional shield construction risk monitoring risk assessment has a large error, so, a subway shield construction risk monitoring information platform based on Cloud&BIM is designed. Firstly, according to the shield construction situation, the overall framework of the platform is designed to optimize the peripheral conditions of data acquisition and communication; The risk index system and risk assessment model of subway shield construction are established to determine the probability of various risks and the loss after the risk occurs. Finally, the risk monitoring of subway shield construction based on Cloud&BIM is realized. Through the simulation of the real shield construction project, the experimental results show that the risk monitoring results of the designed platform are close to the probability of the actual shield construction risk in the simulation software, which verifies the effectiveness of the designed monitoring platform. Keywords: Cloud&BIM; Shield of metro; Construction risk monitoring
